"""Classification of the soundness findings of review rounds 1-3 by root cause.

Each row: (id, source, kind, primary, secondary, title).

kind:
  U   unsound: the checker accepts a program that faults or breaks a design rule
  FP  false positive that fact generation (or a rule) causes
  H   a hypothesis of the proof link is false (no unsound acceptance)
  I   interpreter-only defect (outside fact generation)
  N   not a soundness finding (names, messages, docs, speed, crash)
  DUP duplicate of another row (the 'secondary' field names the original)
  REJ rejected by the fixer as not reproducible

source:
  R1  review round 1 reports (redteam_review.md, spec_review.md, quality_review.md, interp_report.md)
  R1V round 1 stage verifiers (round1a_results.json, round1b_results.json): V001-V072
  R2  review round 2 reports (r2/*.md)
  R2V S5a and R2a-R2e stage verifiers (round2_results.json): V073-V138
  R3  review round 3 reports (r3/*.md)
  OL  'Open after' and 'open, recorded in ADRs' lists of round1b_tasks.md
"""

